Begin "Add and Enable system settings"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "System" charttab
	Click the "System Settings" charttab subtab
	Begin "Add preferred name in Patient Search"
		Click the "Add System Setting" link
		Enter "Show preferred name on results" into the "System Settings" autocomplete
		Select "Enabled" in the "Value" dropdown
		Type "Chart search test" in the "Reason" input
		Click the "Add" button
	Begin "Add preferred name in Recent Patients"
		Click the "Add System Setting" link
		Enter "Show Preferred Name Column" into the "System Settings" autocomplete
		Select "Enabled" in the "Value" dropdown
		Type "Recent Patient test" in the "Reason" input
		Click the "Add" button
Begin Register Patient and Create Preferred name
	Begin Register Patient
		Open the sidemenu
		Click the "E-Chart" sidemenu entry
		Click the "Patient Registration" charttab
		Type "Bond" in the "Last Name" input
		Type "James" in the "First Name" input
		Enter "01-23-1975" into the "Birth Date" date
		Click the "Add New" button
	Begin Create Preferred name
		Open the "Demographic Information" dynamicsection
		Type "Agent" in the "Preferred First Name" input
		Type "Danger" in the "Preferred Middle Name" input
		Type "007" in the "Preferred Last Name" input
		Save the "Demographic Information" dynamicsection
Begin Check Preferred Name in Recent Patients and Simple Search
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "E-Chart" sidemenu entry
	Verify exists "Agent" text
	Verify exists "Danger" text
	Verify exists "007" text
	Click @the "Name" radio button@xpath="//input[@value='n']"
	Type "007, Agent" in the @search input@xpath="//input[@name='sstring']"
	Screenshot "Recent Patients"
	Click the "Search" Button
	Wait for ajax
	Verify exists "Bond, James (Agent Danger 007)" link
Begin Check Preferred Name in Detailed Search
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "E-Chart" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Detailed" link
	Type "Agent" in the @first name input@xpath="//input[@id='first_name']"
	Select "All" in the "Partition" dropdown
	Click the "Search" button
	Wait for ajax
	Verify exists "Bond, James (Agent Danger 007)" link
	Screenshot "Got here"